{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-07-22 07:05:00', 'title': 'LITTLE LIBERIA WINS $100,000 COMERICA HATCH DETROIT CONTEST POWERED BY TECHTOWN', 'text': '10TH ANNUAL HATCH OFF COMPETITION BRINGS AFRO-FUSION RESTAURANT TO DETROIT DETROIT , JULY 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LITTLE LIBERIA HAS BEEN CROWNED THE WINNER OF THE 2022 COMERICA HATCH DETROIT CONTEST, TAKING HOME THE $100,000 GRAND PRIZE FROM COMERICA BANK TO OPEN THE BRICK-AND-MORTAR BUSINESS OF THEIR DREAMS IN DETROIT. AS THE WINNER OF THE 10TH ANNUAL HATCH OFF, LITTLE LIBERIA WILL RECEIVE $100,000 FROM COMERICA BANK AND A PACKAGE OF PRO BONO SUPPORT AND COUNSEL FROM HATCH DETROIT POWERED BY ITS PARTNERS TO BOLSTER ITS OPPORTUNITY FOR SUCCESS.'}